  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crisis response for securing reliable energy access in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Crisis response for securing reliable energy access in Ukraine - This measure will assist in strengthening Ukraine&#xbf;s energy resilience, notably through support to further decentralisation of energy production. The aim is to enable highly flexible interventions to help Ukraine and in particular its decentralised authorities, maintain energy production in an extremely volatile situation. In a first and most urgent stage, the action will mobilise assistance that will contribute to winterisation efforts at a decentralised level, for example by procuring equipment or material to regional authorities and municipalities to help them continue secure energy provision to critical civilian infrastructure as necessary for the delivery of basic services.The action will further accelerate the crisis-proofing of Ukraine&#xbf;s energy production capacities by implementing  evidence-based solutions for a more decentralised and resilient energy generation network in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
